<!doctype lake><title>🐿️ 𝓣𝓱𝓸𝓾𝓰𝓱𝓽</title><meta name="doc-version" content="1" /><meta name="viewport" content="adapt" /><meta name="typography" content="classic" /><meta name="paragraphSpacing" content="relax" /><meta name="defaultFontsize" content="16" /><h1 data-lake-id="s9fyD" id="s9fyD" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u3f98fda9" id="u3f98fda9">🌳</span><span data-lake-id="ufad5de81" id="ufad5de81"> 𝐓𝐫𝐞𝐞 𝐨𝐟 𝐓𝐡𝐨𝐮𝐠𝐡𝐭𝐬: 𝐃𝐞𝐥𝐢𝐛𝐞𝐫𝐚𝐭𝐞 𝐏𝐫𝐨𝐛𝐥𝐞𝐦 𝐒𝐨𝐥𝐯𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐰𝐢𝐭𝐡 𝐋𝐚𝐫𝐠𝐞 𝐋𝐚𝐧𝐠𝐮𝐚𝐠𝐞 𝐌𝐨𝐝𝐞𝐥𝐬</span></h1><p data-lake-id="ua79ab327" id="ua79ab327"><strong><span data-lake-id="u8604f7a7" id="u8604f7a7">人类在决策时具有两种模式：一种是快速、自动且无意识的模式，即系统 1；另一种是缓慢、审慎且有意识的模式，即系统 2</span></strong></p><ul list="u10d5aa31"><li fid="u78523412" data-lake-id="u0f30ab68" id="u0f30ab68"><span data-lake-id="uca441b37" id="uca441b37">语言模型所进行的简单、联想式的 token 级选择，同样令人联想到系统 1。引入更为审慎的系统 2 规划过程，可能有助于增强语言模型的能力</span></li><li fid="u78523412" data-lake-id="ue44a5d99" id="ue44a5d99"><span data-lake-id="u7fa0f558" id="u7fa0f558">规划过程应当维护并探索当前决策的多种候选方案，而非仅选择其中一种；评估当前状态，并主动进行前瞻或回溯，以作出更具全局性的决策</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ub777c719" id="ub777c719"><strong><span data-lake-id="uca403c57" id="uca403c57">提出思维树（Tree of Thoughts，ToT）框架，用于借助语言模型进行通用问题求解</span></strong></p><ul list="u7f1deff5"><li fid="u99944ca6" data-lake-id="ua1137ea0" id="ua1137ea0"><span data-lake-id="u189572ac" id="u189572ac">ToT 主动维护一棵思维树，其中每个思维单元都是一段连贯的语言序列，用于表示问题求解过程中的一个中间步骤。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u3c6e08f7" id="u3c6e08f7" style="color: #5C0036">借助这种高层语义单元，语言模型能够通过同样以语言形式实现的审慎推理过程，自行评估不同中间思维单元在解决问题方面取得的进展</span></strong></li><li fid="u99944ca6" data-lake-id="ue9623287" id="ue9623287"><span data-lake-id="u70826ac6" id="u70826ac6">通过语言模型的自我评估与审慎推理来实现搜索启发式，是一种新的方式，因为以往的搜索启发式要么通过编程实现，要么通过学习获得</span></li><li fid="u99944ca6" data-lake-id="u98a9abbc" id="u98a9abbc"><span data-lake-id="u853c3a96" id="u853c3a96">将这种基于语言生成和评估多样化思维的能力，与广度优先搜索或深度优先搜索等搜索算法相结合，从而通过前瞻与回溯，对思维树进行系统性探索</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="xuCoF" id="xuCoF" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u96c58315" id="u96c58315">🦉</span><span data-lake-id="u14e0ece3" id="u14e0ece3"> 𝐓𝐫𝐞𝐞 𝐨𝐟 𝐓𝐡𝐨𝐮𝐠𝐡𝐭𝐬: 𝐃𝐞𝐥𝐢𝐛𝐞𝐫𝐚𝐭𝐞 𝐏𝐫𝐨𝐛𝐥𝐞𝐦 𝐒𝐨𝐥𝐯𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐰𝐢𝐭𝐡 𝐋𝐌</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u559cc371" id="u559cc371"><strong><span data-lake-id="u67015760" id="u67015760">真正的问题求解过程，需要反复利用已有信息展开探索，而探索又会揭示更多信息，直至最终发现获得解答的方法。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u9eba766e" id="u9eba766e">关于人类问题求解的研究表明，人们会在组合问题空间中进行搜索。这一空间可以表示为一棵树，其中节点代表部分解，分支则对应于修改这些部分解的算子</span></p><ul list="u46f291fc"><li fid="u1cf3400c" data-lake-id="u3d7d03b1" id="u3d7d03b1"><span data-lake-id="uc4db6eff" id="uc4db6eff">选择哪条分支由启发式策略决定，这些策略帮助求解者在问题空间中进行探索，并引导其逐步找到解答</span></li><li fid="u1cf3400c" data-lake-id="ued21ff61" id="ued21ff61"><span data-lake-id="u2e567fa1" id="u2e567fa1">这一视角揭示现有语言模型通用问题求解方法的两个关键不足：在局部层面，它们不会在同一思维过程中探索不同的后续路径，即树中的不同分支；在全局层面，它们没有引入规划、前瞻或回溯机制，以帮助评估这些不同选项，而这种由启发式引导的搜索似乎正是人类问题求解的重要特征</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uaf3f4be2" id="uaf3f4be2"><strong><span data-lake-id="u2b1850a6" id="u2b1850a6" style="color: #DF2A3F">思维树这一范式允许语言模型围绕思维单元探索多条推理路径。ToT 将任意问题建模为树上的搜索，其中每个节点对应一个状态</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s%3D%5Bx%2Cz_%7B1%5C%5Ccdots%20i%7D%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3c9be49e2c70cb7dec94af0a9aad499c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22PvzTf%22%7D" style="color: #DF2A3F"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u1f43b51c" id="u1f43b51c" style="color: #DF2A3F">，该状态由输入及当前已有的思维序列组成，表示一个部分解。ToT 的具体实现需要回答四个问题：（1）如何将中间过程分解为思维步骤；（2）如何从每个状态生成候选思维；（3）如何以启发式方式评估状态；（4）采用何种搜索算法</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="uc713038d" id="uc713038d"><strong><span data-lake-id="u0b82fb9f" id="u0b82fb9f">思维分解：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u83527fbe" id="u83527fbe">CoT 连续采样思维序列，而不显式规定其分解方式；ToT 则利用问题本身的特性，设计并划分中间思维步骤</span></p><p data-lake-id="u1d4db622" id="u1d4db622"><strong><span data-lake-id="ub6edb7ca" id="ub6edb7ca">思维生成器</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22G(p_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D%2Cs%2Ck)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8129ea56f4722221e9490b7d7a2ea3d0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22C5rxK%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ua5070928" id="ua5070928">：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ufa33c5d8" id="ufa33c5d8">给定树中的状态</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s%3D%5Bx%2Cz_%7B1%5C%5Ccdots%20i%7D%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3c9be49e2c70cb7dec94af0a9aad499c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22tlU3D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u17589e50" id="u17589e50">，考虑以下两种策略，为下一个思维步骤生成</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22k%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdf976ff7fcf17d60490267d18a1e3996.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22BjdCL%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u059a2287" id="u059a2287">个候选</span></p><ul list="u552cb1f0"><li fid="u497871e3" data-lake-id="u5b16d575" id="u5b16d575"><strong><span data-lake-id="uf42210ad" id="uf42210ad">利用 CoT 提示独立同分布地采样思维。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u11fb61e7" id="u11fb61e7"> 该策略用于创意写作任务，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22z%5E%7B(j)%7D%5C%5Csim%20p_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D%5E%7BCoT%7D(z_%7Bi%2B1%7D%7Cs)%3Dp_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D%5E%7BCoT%7D(z_%7Bi%2B1%7D%7Cx%2Cz_%7B1%5C%5Ccdots%20i%7D)%5C%5C%20(j%3D1%5C%5Ccdots%20k)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4ac1c97de1cd9f16ff990ab00bc6ce1b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22QMQZx%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua8a657f3" id="ua8a657f3">。当思维空间较为丰富时，例如每个思维单元都是一个段落，这种方式表现更好，因为独立同分布采样能够带来多样性</span></li><li fid="u497871e3" data-lake-id="u53baa162" id="u53baa162"><strong><span data-lake-id="ue465b996" id="ue465b996">利用提议提示（propose prompt）依次提出思维。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u119cc30c" id="u119cc30c"> </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5Bz%5E%7B(1)%7D%2C%5C%5Ccdots%2Cz%5E%7B(k)%7D%5D%5C%5Csim%20p_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D%5E%7Bpropose%7D(z_%7Bi%2B1%7D%5E%7B(1%5C%5Ccdots%20k)%7D%5C%5Cmid%20s)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6755e18ec235b5f071a8c509bbbff34d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wBbPW%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u99423a38" id="u99423a38">。当思维空间受到较强约束时，例如每个思维单元仅为一个单词或一行内容，这种方式表现更好，因为在同一上下文中提出不同思维能够避免重复</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ue1ad0edf" id="ue1ad0edf"><strong><span data-lake-id="u65940433" id="u65940433">状态评估器 </span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22V(p_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D%2CS)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F95e6222d2908b7ebdd3e9609b2e1a833.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22FOsrw%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uc9d98ef6" id="uc9d98ef6">。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u900cae58" id="u900cae58"> 给定搜索前沿的一组不同状态，状态评估器评估这些状态在问题求解方面取得的进展，并将其作为搜索算法的启发式依据，以确定应当继续探索哪些状态，以及按何种顺序进行探索</span></p><ul list="u9326b248"><li fid="ueb8a675d" data-lake-id="u122faef3" id="u122faef3"><span data-lake-id="ucd31cf07" id="ucd31cf07">尽管启发式策略是解决搜索问题的常用方法，但它们通常要么通过编程实现，要么通过学习获得。提出第三种选择，即利用语言模型对状态进行审慎推理。在适用的情况下，这种基于审慎推理的启发式策略可以比预先编写的规则更加灵活，并且比通过学习获得的模型具有更高的样本效率。与思维生成器类似，考虑两种状态评估策略，分别对状态进行独立评估或联合评估</span></li></ul><ul list="u9326b248" data-lake-indent="1"><li fid="ueb8a675d" data-lake-id="u39960925" id="u39960925"><strong><span data-lake-id="u374323df" id="u374323df">独立评估各个状态的价值</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u803e6e51" id="u803e6e51"> </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22V(p_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D%2CS)(s)%5C%5Csim%20p_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D%5E%7Bvalue%7D(v%7Cs)%5C%5C%20%5C%5Cforall%20s%5C%5Cin%20S%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fda2ce9c9ec8f8b6699ae0d2218e0d208.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uvBkh%22%7D"></card></li><li fid="ueb8a675d" data-lake-id="u8e608265" id="u8e608265"><strong><span data-lake-id="u0e885105" id="u0e885105">在多个状态之间进行投票</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u3699b749" id="u3699b749"> </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22V(p_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D%2CS)(s)%3D%5C%5Cmathbb%7B1%7D%5Bs%3Ds%5E%7B*%7D%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F23c48bd8d667d41fd9f0c02b57009d83.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ESHcz%22%7D"></card></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uc6280b9b" id="uc6280b9b"><strong><span data-lake-id="u10e94cb1" id="u10e94cb1">搜索算法：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u3a2291a5" id="u3a2291a5">在 ToT 框架中，可以根据树的结构，以即插即用的方式采用不同的搜索算法</span></p><ul list="u586eb4a8"><li fid="u4b773c6c" data-lake-id="u90508cac" id="u90508cac"><strong><span data-lake-id="u6712db80" id="u6712db80">广度优先搜索（BFS）。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u3add5d94" id="u3add5d94"> 该算法在每一步维护由</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22b%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd29c2e5f4926e5b0e9a95305650f6e54.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22cUVH7%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4848ece3" id="u4848ece3">个最有希望的状态组成的集合</span></li><li fid="u4b773c6c" data-lake-id="u6029a90a" id="u6029a90a"><strong><span data-lake-id="uf10e289a" id="uf10e289a">深度优先搜索（DFS）。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u144b2236" id="u144b2236"> 该算法优先探索最有希望的状态，直至得到最终输出，或者状态评估器认为无法从当前状态</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F79ce3c7a71877c2ff01695e38ade43ca.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22VHzIB%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9371dd95" id="u9371dd95">出发解决问题，即对于给定的价值阈值</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22v_%7Bth%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc4ee2843523276fd250f549b0b699c27.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22fd6bc%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0452a0ec" id="u0452a0ec">，有</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22V(p_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D%2C%5C%5C%7Bs%5C%5C%7D)(s)%5C%5Cleq%20v_%7Bth%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0e575ee8ca8c4861a3d6ddc1d5b2b3dc.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jqeGx%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u28f36940" id="u28f36940">。在后一种情况下，以</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F79ce3c7a71877c2ff01695e38ade43ca.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22sSxOM%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8b0ef8cf" id="u8b0ef8cf">为根的子树会被剪枝，以减少探索并侧重利用。在这两种情况下，DFS 都会回溯至</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F79ce3c7a71877c2ff01695e38ade43ca.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22tFo9B%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf338e4da" id="uf338e4da">的父状态，继续进行探索</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uf65a6c75" id="uf65a6c75" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1790970704647-d2370d9d-e9a6-4881-8b7b-c8e78a6d31c8.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u68bac534-c07d-4219-bf21-6561d79ffdc%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u21af1ec6-93c8-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A817.6000366210938%2C%22height%22%3A274%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A152750%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1112%2C%22originHeight%22%3A372%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22stroke%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22RG()RKEQUIRE%3ACURRENTSTATES%2CSTEPT%2CLMPE%2CTHOUGHT%22%2C%22x%22%3A501%2C%22y%22%3A62%2C%22width%22%3A591%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ST-FS%2C2SESI-1%2C2TEG(D0%2CS%2CN)%7DFORS'EG(PE.%22%2C%22x%22%3A86%2C%22y%22%3A204%2C%22width%22%3A661%2C%22height%22%3A29%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FORSEG(PE%2CS%2CKDOSORTEDCANDIDATE%22%2C%22x%22%3A575%2C%22y%22%3A207%2C%22width%22%3A498%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22GENERATORG)ANDSIZELIMITK%2CSTATESEVALUATOR%22%2C%22x%22%3A576%2C%22y%22%3A91%2C%22width%22%3A523%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ALGORITHM2TOT-DFS(S%2CT%2CPE%2C